    "section": "12. Fight Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "12.00",
    "order": 155,
    "anchor": "12.00",
    "summary": "Both players act: units pile in to get as many models as possible into engagement, everyone makes melee attacks, then units consolidate. The phase has 5 steps:\n\n1. [Start Of Fight Phase](vsdata:core-rule/start-of-fight-phase)\n2. [Pile In Step](vsdata:core-rule/pile-in-step)\n3. [Fight Step](vsdata:core-rule/fight-step)\n4. [Consolidate Step](vsdata:core-rule/consolidate-step)\n5. [End Of Fight Phase](vsdata:core-rule/end-of-fight-phase)",
